Stiwo
$cards
DECK 1 SPADES

$initial
EMOUD 3 FACE_HALF
EMOUD 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
EMOUD 1 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
EMOUD 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE EMOUD EMOUD
OR
    AND
        DEST Suit {CLUBS, SPADES, DIAMONDS, HEARTS}
        SRC Rank 1
    SRC Rank 1
MOVE_STACK EMOUD EMOUD
SRC Rank K
$win
OR
    PILE ALL EMOUD Empty
    PILE ALL EMOUD Empty
